    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap IBUS (FlySky) 14-Channel Receiver Decoder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>IBUS Protocol Specifications:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Baud rate: 115,200 bps, 8N1.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Frame length: 32 bytes.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Header: 0x20 0x40</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Channels: 14 16-bit little-endian channels (bytes 2..29, raw 1000..2000 us).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Checksum: 16-bit sum checksum (<computeroutput>0xFFFF - sum(bytes[0..29])</computeroutput>). </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
